= Esoteric programming language — Simple =

An '''esoteric programming language''', or '''esolang''', is a programming language made mainly to explore strange ideas, create art, make puzzles, or challenge normal ideas about programming.

Most esolangs are not designed to build ordinary business software.

Some deliberately make programming difficult.

Others try to use extremely few instructions or unusual ways of writing code.

An esolang can still teach useful things about computation and programming-language design.

It also does not have to be Turing complete.

